== Checklist ==

{{CheckboxList}}
* ('''OPTIONAL''') Hail [[A Visiting Priestess]] in [[Najena]] who then asks "Are you the champion that Najena sent for?". You say "I will champion for Najena"
* Get the [[:Ice Crystal Staff]] from [[a goblin scryer]] in [[Permafrost]]
* Get the [[:Water Crystal Staff]] from [[Webclaw Murkwave]] in [[Lake Rathetear]]
* Get the [[:Slime Crystal Staff]] from [[King Xorbb]] in [[Beholder's Maze]]
* Get the [[:Fire Crystal Staff]] from [[goblin drunkard]] in [[Solusek's Eye]]
* Give [[A Visiting Priestess]] the [[:Ice Crystal Staff]] , the [[:Water Crystal Staff]] , the [[:Slime Crystal Staff]] , and the [[:Fire Crystal Staff]]
* Pick up [[Scroll of Flayed Goblin Skin]] from the ground near where [[A Visiting Priestess]] was.
* ('''OPTIONAL''') Give [[Nallar Q`Tentu]] the [[Scroll of Flayed Goblin Skin]] and a [[:Star Ruby]] and receive [[Scroll of Flayed Goblin Skin]] back.
* Get a [[:Vial of Noble's Blood]] from [[a fallen noble]] in [[Mistmoore Castle]] 
* ('''OPTIONAL''')  Give [[Zanotix Ixtaz]] 75 pp
* ('''OPTIONAL''')  Go to [[Nallar Q`Tentu]] and say "Denouncer Ixtaz sent me"
* Go to [[Zanotix Ixtaz]] give him [[:Vial of Noble's Blood]], a spirit will appear in the blue flames.
* Give the spirit the [[Scroll of Flayed Goblin Skin]] and receive the [[:Blued Two-Handed Hammer]].
